      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A lightningtalk and demo about LiVES, an open source Video Editing System.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The lightning talk will demonstrate the features of LiVES and show how it can be used both by VJ&amp;#39;s and digital video artists to produce eye-catching and spectacular results.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;About LiVES:&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;LiVES is a Video Editing System. It allows both realtime and non-realtime manipulation of video and audio. It can be controlled either through the user-friendly interface or remotely over a network. It has the capability of working with almost any video format. It can also be easily extended through a system of plugins, utilising open standards.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
